 ## Languages

 Messages exist in English (`en`) and Korean (`ko`), in
-`src/i18n/messages.js`. The server answers in `LARDER_LANG` (default `en`).
+`src/i18n/messages.js`. The server selects `en` or `ko` from the request's
+`Accept-Language` header, honoring quality (`q`) values and region tags such
+as `ko-KR`. Zero-quality and unsupported languages are ignored; equal-quality
+matches use header order. If no supported language matches, the server uses
+`LARDER_LANG` (default `en`). All error codes, including `internal`, have
+messages in both languages.
